{"content":"{\"chapter_contract_id\":\"contract:v2-n-10-1-3:v2\",\"node_id\":\"v2_n_10_1_3\",\"schema_version\":\"ordered_chapter_draft_candidate.v1\",\"known_evidence_ids\":[],\"blocks\":[{\"block_id\":\"blk:v2_n_10_1_3:p1\",\"kind\":\"paragraph\",\"text\":\"本节相关性判断采用五级术语：肯定有关、很可能有关、可能有关、可能无关、无关（肯定无关）。不得将上述五分法折叠为“有关/无关”二分结论。相关性判断依据ICH E2A、CIOMS、NMPA药物临床试验质量管理规范及WHO-UMC因果关系评价原则，由研究者综合判断；上述依据以当前生效的法规、指南或原则为准，征求意见稿或草案文本不得作为现行依据。\",\"evidence_refs\":[],\"source_locator\":\"\"},{\"block_id\":\"blk:v2_n_10_1_3:p2\",\"kind\":\"paragraph\",\"text\":\"逐级判定由研究者根据事件发生时间与试验用药品给药的时间关系、临床过程、已知药理作用、去激发或再激发、混杂因素及既往病史等综合判断相关性；必要时由申办者医学人员复核。各级别均须记录综合判断依据，不能仅记录“有关/无关”二分结果。\",\"evidence_refs\":[],\"source_locator\":\"\"},{\"block_id\":\"blk:v2_n_10_1_3:tbl-five-level\",\"kind\":\"table\",\"evidence_refs\":[],\"table\":{\"table_id\":\"tbl:v2_n_10_1_3:five-level\",\"block_id\":\"blk:v2_n_10_1_3:tbl-five-level\",\"title\":\"表 10-1-3 相关性五级术语、定义与判定依据\",\"domain\":\"ae_management\",\"role\":\"body_content\",\"review_state\":\"ai_draft\",\"version\":0,\"schema_version\":\"structured_table_v1\",\"header_row_count\":1,\"source_locator\":\"\",\"word_layout\":{},\"columns\":[{\"column_id\":\"col:level\",\"label\":\"级别\",\"order\":0,\"semantic_role\":\"level\",\"style_role\":\"header\",\"source_locator\":\"\",\"width_twips\":null},{\"column_id\":\"col:definition\",\"label\":\"定义\",\"order\":1,\"semantic_role\":\"definition\",\"style_role\":\"header\",\"source_locator\":\"\",\"width_twips\":null},{\"column_id\":\"col:basis\",\"label\":\"判定依据\",\"order\":2,\"semantic_role\":\"basis\",\"style_role\":\"header\",\"source_locator\":\"\",\"width_twips\":null}],\"rows\":[{\"row_id\":\"row:header\",\"order\":0,\"label\":\"\",\"style_role\":\"header\",\"source_locator\":\"\",\"cells\":[{\"cell_id\":\"causality:cell:level\",\"row_id\":\"row:header\",\"column_id\":\"col:level\",\"text\":\"级别\",\"style_role\":\"header\",\"source_locator\":\"\",\"column_span\":1,\"row_span\":1,\"condition_expression\":\"\",\"note_refs\":[],\"provenance_lineage\":[],\"rich_text\":null,\"semantic_value\":null},{\"cell_id\":\"causality:cell:definition\",\"row_id\":\"row:header\",\"column_id\":\"col:definition\",\"text\":\"定义\",\"style_role\":\"header\",\"source_locator\":\"\",\"column_span\":1,\"row_span\":1,\"condition_expression\":\"\",\"note_refs\":[],\"provenance_lineage\":[],\"rich_text\":null,\"semantic_value\":null},{\"cell_id\":\"causality:cell:basis\",\"row_id\":\"row:header\",\"column_id\":\"col:basis\",\"text\":\"判定依据\",\"style_role\":\"header\",\"source_locator\":\"\",\"column_span\":1,\"row_span\":1,\"condition_expression\":\"\",\"note_refs\":[],\"provenance_lineage\":[],\"rich_text\":null,\"semantic_value\":null}]},{\"row_id\":\"row:certain\",\"order\":1,\"label\":\"肯定有关\",\"style_role\":\"body\",\"source_locator\":\"\",\"cells\":[{\"cell_id\":\"cell:five-level:certain:level\",\"row_id\":\"row:certain\",\"column_id\":\"col:level\",\"text\":\"肯定有关\",\"style_role\":\"body\",\"source_locator\":\"\",\"column_span\":1,\"row_span\":1,\"condition_expression\":\"\",\"note_refs\":[],\"provenance_lineage\":[],\"rich_text\":null,\"semantic_value\":null},{\"cell_id\":\"cell:five-level:certain:definition\",\"row_id\":\"row:certain\",\"column_id\":\"col:definition\",\"text\":\"综合判断明确支持事件与试验用药品存在因果关系。\",\"style_role\":\"body\",\"source_locator\":\"\",\"column_span\":1,\"row_span\":1,\"condition_expression\":\"\",\"note_refs\":[],\"provenance_lineage\":[],\"rich_text\":null,\"semantic_value\":null},{\"cell_id\":\"cell:five-level:certain:basis\",\"row_id\":\"row:certain\",\"column_id\":\"col:basis\",\"text\":\"事件发生时间与给药的时间关系、临床过程、已知药理作用、去激发或再激发、混杂因素及既往病史等综合信息均支持因果关系，且无更合理解释。\",\"style_role\":\"body\",\"source_locator\":\"\",\"column_span\":1,\"row_span\":1,\"condition_expression\":\"\",\"note_refs\":[],\"provenance_lineage\":[],\"rich_text\":null,\"semantic_value\":null}]},{\"row_id\":\"row:probable\",\"order\":2,\"label\":\"很可能有关\",\"style_role\":\"body\",\"source_locator\":\"\",\"cells\":[{\"cell_id\":\"cell:five-level:probable:level\",\"row_id\":\"row:probable\",\"column_id\":\"col:level\",\"text\":\"很可能有关\",\"style_role\":\"body\",\"source_locator\":\"\",\"column_span\":1,\"row_span\":1,\"condition_expression\":\"\",\"note_refs\":[],\"provenance_lineage\":[],\"rich_text\":null,\"semantic_value\":null},{\"cell_id\":\"cell:five-level:probable:definition\",\"row_id\":\"row:probable\",\"column_id\":\"col:definition\",\"text\":\"综合判断支持事件与试验用药品存在因果关系，但证据强度未达到肯定有关。\",\"style_role\":\"body\",\"source_locator\":\"\",\"column_span\":1,\"row_span\":1,\"condition_expression\":\"\",\"note_refs\":[],\"provenance_lineage\":[],\"rich_text\":null,\"semantic_value\":null},{\"cell_id\":\"cell:five-level:probable:basis\",\"row_id\":\"row:probable\",\"column_id\":\"col:basis\",\"text\":\"上述综合信息中多数关键因素支持因果关系，但仍存在未完全排除的替代解释或信息不足。\",\"style_role\":\"body\",\"source_locator\":\"\",\"column_span\":1,\"row_span\":1,\"condition_expression\":\"\",\"note_refs\":[],\"provenance_lineage\":[],\"rich_text\":null,\"semantic_value\":null}]},{\"row_id\":\"row:possible\",\"order\":3,\"label\":\"可能有关\",\"style_role\":\"body\",\"source_locator\":\"\",\"cells\":[{\"cell_id\":\"cell:five-level:possible:level\",\"row_id\":\"row:possible\",\"column_id\":\"col:level\",\"text\":\"可能有关\",\"style_role\":\"body\",\"source_locator\":\"\",\"column_span\":1,\"row_span\":1,\"condition_expression\":\"\",\"note_refs\":[],\"provenance_lineage\":[],\"rich_text\":null,\"semantic_value\":null},{\"cell_id\":\"cell:five-level:possible:definition\",\"row_id\":\"row:possible\",\"column_id\":\"col:definition\",\"text\":\"不能排除事件与试验用药品存在因果关系，但证据不足以判定为很可能有关。\",\"style_role\":\"body\",\"source_locator\":\"\",\"column_span\":1,\"row_span\":1,\"condition_expression\":\"\",\"note_refs\":[],\"provenance_lineage\":[],\"rich_text\":null,\"semantic_value\":null},{\"cell_id\":\"cell:five-level:possible:basis\",\"row_id\":\"row:possible\",\"column_id\":\"col:basis\",\"text\":\"时间关系、临床过程、药理作用、去激发或再激发等部分信息支持因果关系，同时存在混杂因素、既往病史或其他解释可能。\",\"style_role\":\"body\",\"source_locator\":\"\",\"column_span\":1,\"row_span\":1,\"condition_expression\":\"\",\"note_refs\":[],\"provenance_lineage\":[],\"rich_text\":null,\"semantic_value\":null}]},{\"row_id\":\"row:possible-unrelated\",\"order\":4,\"label\":\"可能无关\",\"style_role\":\"body\",\"source_locator\":\"\",\"cells\":[{\"cell_id\":\"cell:five-level:possible-unrelated:level\",\"row_id\":\"row:possible-unrelated\",\"column_id\":\"col:level\",\"text\":\"可能无关\",\"style_role\":\"body\",\"source_locator\":\"\",\"column_span\":1,\"row_span\":1,\"condition_expression\":\"\",\"note_refs\":[],\"provenance_lineage\":[],\"rich_text\":null,\"semantic_value\":null},{\"cell_id\":\"cell:five-level:possible-unrelated:definition\",\"row_id\":\"row:possible-unrelated\",\"column_id\":\"col:definition\",\"text\":\"综合判断更倾向于事件与试验用药品无因果关系，但不能完全排除相关性。\",\"style_role\":\"body\",\"source_locator\":\"\",\"column_span\":1,\"row_span\":1,\"condition_expression\":\"\",\"note_refs\":[],\"provenance_lineage\":[],\"rich_text\":null,\"semantic_value\":null},{\"cell_id\":\"cell:five-level:possible-unrelated:basis\",\"row_id\":\"row:possible-unrelated\",\"column_id\":\"col:basis\",\"text\":\"综合信息更支持其他原因，但时间关系、去激发或再激发、混杂因素等尚未达到完全排除相关性的程度。\",\"style_role\":\"body\",\"source_locator\":\"\",\"column_span\":1,\"row_span\":1,\"condition_expression\":\"\",\"note_refs\":[],\"provenance_lineage\":[],\"rich_text\":null,\"semantic_value\":null}]},{\"row_id\":\"row:unrelated\",\"order\":5,\"label\":\"无关（肯定无关）\",\"style_role\":\"body\",\"source_locator\":\"\",\"cells\":[{\"cell_id\":\"cell:five-level:unrelated:level\",\"row_id\":\"row:unrelated\",\"column_id\":\"col:level\",\"text\":\"无关（肯定无关）\",\"style_role\":\"body\",\"source_locator\":\"\",\"column_span\":1,\"row_span\":1,\"condition_expression\":\"\",\"note_refs\":[],\"provenance_lineage\":[],\"rich_text\":null,\"semantic_value\":null},{\"cell_id\":\"cell:five-level:unrelated:definition\",\"row_id\":\"row:unrelated\",\"column_id\":\"col:definition\",\"text\":\"综合判断认为事件与试验用药品无因果关系。\",\"style_role\":\"body\",\"source_locator\":\"\",\"column_span\":1,\"row_span\":1,\"condition_expression\":\"\",\"note_refs\":[],\"provenance_lineage\":[],\"rich_text\":null,\"semantic_value\":null},{\"cell_id\":\"cell:five-level:unrelated:basis\",\"row_id\":\"row:unrelated\",\"column_id\":\"col:basis\",\"text\":\"时间关系、临床过程、药理作用、去激发或再激发、混杂因素及既往病史等综合判断不支持因果关系。\",\"style_role\":\"body\",\"source_locator\":\"\",\"column_span\":1,\"row_span\":1,\"condition_expression\":\"\",\"note_refs\":[],\"provenance_lineage\":[],\"rich_text\":null,\"semantic_value\":null}]}],\"notes\":[]}},{\"block_id\":\"blk:v2_n_10_1_3:p3\",\"kind\":\"paragraph\",\"text\":\"加速报告判定采用独立于统计ADR分组的算法，不得以统计ADR分组静默充当加速报告判定。SAE且与试验用药品相关性为肯定有关、很可能有关或可能有关，或无法排除相关性，且属于非预期不良反应的，按可疑且非预期严重不良反应（SUSAR）流程快速报告；严重但无关或预期的不良反应按SAE报告但不作为SUSAR；非严重AE按常规记录。报告时限遵循NMPA GCP和ICH E2A要求。\",\"evidence_refs\":[],\"source_locator\":\"\"},{\"block_id\":\"blk:v2_n_10_1_3:p4\",\"kind\":\"paragraph\",\"text\":\"对“可能无关”的加速报告处置须单独说明：可能无关不等同于无关；若研究者不能排除相关性，则按“无法排除相关性”纳入SUSAR判定；若最终判定为无关，则严重者按SAE报告但不作为SUSAR，非严重者按常规记录。模板示例中的“有关/无关”二分映射不得用作加速报告算法。\",\"evidence_refs\":[],\"source_locator\":\"\"}]}","receipt":{"idempotency_key":"chapter-draft.generate.v1","input_artifacts":[{"ref":"chapter-intake","sha256":"d7d7bba2f3665c050fb823d0658a192d6e3f3ebc8d710c3b42633b8bd36c456e"}],"logical_call_id":"call:chapter-draft:fa990f13edaa5d51952a3197071f205729c2e4f3d4f4b8869cec33572fbf2526:chapter-generate","node_execution_contract_id":"nec:chapter-draft:fa990f13edaa5d51952a3197071f205729c2e4f3d4f4b8869cec33572fbf2526:chapter-generate","observed_model":"deepseek-flash","observed_provider":"deepseek","output_schema_ref":"https://protocol-v3.local/schemas/ordered-chapter-draft-candidate.v1.json","output_sha256":"780e4ade5877b7378978172992cfdf2f30b89ab328f86dea7be71aa87672b019","prompt_sha256":"47dd66c834319411962b91127cd952207cccdab4dee7068a9ab81409e5aefa1e","provider_session_id":"61c31f6d-4846-4630-a46a-cd4ee583c958","r